---
description: Global non-negotiables for every task
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read AGENTS.md and docs/plans/START_HERE.md before starting
- Copy existing patterns; don't invent new ones
- Money: Decimal only. Never float.
- Never mark a financial field verified without a named human
- Never skip, weaken, or delete a test. Never edit eval/eval_set_v0/.
- Never edit an applied migration
- Log IDs only, never document contents, names, or emails
- `make verify` must pass before saying done. Show real output.
- Append DECISIONS.md when choosing between options; update FLOW.md for new call paths
- Keep project-map.md current when architecture changes. No `.cursorrules`.
- If unsure or the spec looks wrong, stop and ask
